; Jumps C cannot express structurally: leaving two loops at once, restarting an outer loop from an
; inner one, and leaving a block from inside an if. MSL has no goto, so these go through a jump flag
; and a do { } while (false) block; a switch keeps plain breaks.
; RUN: tc-emit --target=metal --no-line-comments %s | FileCheck %s
; RUN: tc-emit --target=metal %s | mslcheck
; RUN: tc-emit --target=metal %s | metalc
; ---- autogenerated by utils/update-checks.py; edit with care ----
